Files with CRLF line endings outline in every engine as with LF: line counts and line ranges
count each CRLF once, header comments of several lines print one line each, and multi-line
signatures, selectors, and values print on one line, with no `\r` left anywhere (a TOML `"""`
string and a YAML `|` block join their lines with spaces, as with LF).
== args
input/crlf.md
input/crlf.ts
input/crlf.tsx
input/crlf.js
input/crlf.rs
input/crlf.css
input/crlf.json
input/crlf.toml
input/crlf.yaml
